        "sid": "2CH 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu Thɔ-lo-mon luak Kuɔth Nhial tok kɛ ta̱th kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm Pääm Mɔ-ri-ya, gua̱a̱th ëë ci Kuoth Nhial rɔ nyuɔ̱th gua̱n ni Dee-bid thi̱n. Gua̱a̱th ëë ci Dee-bid ɛ mɛk gua̱th kɔ̱mä bɛɛl Ɔr-nan raan Yɛ-buth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ ta̱thdɛ tok kɛ rɛw päthni kɛ ŋuaan runi ruecädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ti̱ti̱ a theemni te täthɛ luak Kuɔth. Cu bärɛ piny a jua̱th tetni ti jiɛn bäkɛl, kä ɣäp ɣääpdɛ a jua̱th tetni ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bäŋ luaak a jua̱th tetni ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw bärɛ piny kɛnɛ ɣäp ɣääpdɛ, päärɛ kɛ ɣäp ɣääp luak",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "luak",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Luak mat kɛ ni jɛ thi̱n kɛ ɣöö bikɛ pa̱a̱r kɛnɛ 1 Kua̱r 6:3 thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru thilɛ jɛ kä 2 Kuɛ̈n 3:4.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Kä cu bärɛ cuŋä a jua̱th te̱tni ti kuɔ̱r kɛl wi̱cdɛ jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw. Kä cuɛ rɛydɛ rɔth kɛ da̱a̱p mi lɛy lɛy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ puɔ̱ny luaak kum kɛ jiɛn, kä cuɛ rɔth kɛ da̱a̱p mi lɛy lɛy kä cuɛ jɛ kɛt kɛ ti ce̱tkɛ dɛy nöör kɛnɛ kuatni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ luak biɛl kɛ pääm ti di̱t kökdiɛn, kɛ da̱a̱p mi nööŋkɛ nikä Par-wa-yim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ puɔ̱ny luaak, kɛ tut luaak, kɛ thiekni kɛ wääthni rɔth kɛ da̱a̱p. Kä cuɛ pua̱ny ti ce̱tkɛ pua̱ny jaakni lät kä puɔ̱ny luaak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ duel in rɛl gɔɔydɛ di̱tdɛ rɔ la̱t. Cu bärɛ kɛnɛ ɣääpdɛ a jua̱th tetni ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw. Kä cuɛ jɛ rɔth kɛ da̱a̱p mi lɛy lɛy mi te ki̱luni ti kur bäkɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ thöt la̱t kɛ da̱a̱p mi tëë ki̱luni da̱ŋ wäl dhieec. Kä cuɛ wi̱c duëël rɔth kɛ da̱a̱p.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ pua̱ny da̱ŋ rɛw ti ce̱tkɛ pua̱ny ja̱a̱kni la̱t kɛ jiath rɛy duëël in rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ, kä cuɛ kɛ rɔth kɛ da̱a̱p. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä gɔ̱kiɛn kɛn da̱ŋ rɛw kɛ jua̱th tetni ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw. Te gɔ̱a̱k kuec kɛl kɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ dhieec, wä gɔ̱kiɛn yiëth ni puɔ̱ny duëël kui̱c ɛ mi kɛnɛ kui̱c in dɔ̱ŋ, kä ro̱m gɔ̱kiɛn däär. Kä kɛn cikɛ cuɔ̱ŋ luɔckɛ nhiamdiɛn rɛy luaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.11+2CH.3.12+2CH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.11",
              "2CH.3.12",
              "2CH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ geel la̱t kɛ bi mi yiel kɛnɛ mi do̱l kɛ mi dɛ̈ɛ̈r, kä cuɛ kɛ kët pua̱ny ti ce̱tkɛ pua̱ny ja̱a̱kni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wääthni yieethä min yian da̱ŋ rɛw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wääthni da̱ŋ rɛw la̱t thok luaak raar, bäriɛn nhial ɛ jua̱th tetni ti jiɛn da̱ŋ diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ dhieec, te mɔ kɛ wi̱c, mi te jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ dhieec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ti ce̱tkɛ kuatni la̱t, kä cuɛ kɛ la̱th nhial wääthni. Kä cuɛ rɛydiɛn ruɔ̱p ti ce̱tkɛ dɛy nöör ti kuɔ̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wääthni cuŋ raar thok luaak, te kɛl kui̱c cuëëc, te min dɔ̱ŋ kui̱c caam. Kä cuɛ min te kui̱c cuëëc cɔli Ya-kin, kä cuɛ min te kui̱c caam cɔli Bo-ɛ̈dh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
